        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Giovanni Ribisi, Alison Wright, Marius Josipovic, Pete Murphy, Martha Hanson, Marjorie\n- Works: Sneaky Pete, The Americans\n- Roles: actor, actress, convict\n\nFacts:\n- Giovanni Ribisi was born on December 17, 1974, and he is an American film and television actor.\n- Alison Wright was born on July 12, 1976, and she is an English actress.\n- In Sneaky Pete, Marius Josipovic is a released convict who adopts the identity of his cell mate Pete Murphy to avoid his past life.\n- Giovanni Ribisi plays Marius Josipovic in Sneaky Pete.\n- Alison Wright is known for playing Martha Hanson on The Americans and Marjorie on Sneaky Pete.",
